#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/toggles.py
msgid ""
"openpilot defaults to driving in chill mode. Experimental mode enables "
"alpha-level features that aren't ready for chill mode. Experimental features"
" are listed below:<br><h4>End-to-End Longitudinal Control</h4><br>Let the "
"driving model control the gas and brakes. openpilot will drive as it thinks "
"a human would, including stopping for red lights and stop signs. Since the "
"driving model decides the speed to drive, the set speed will only act as an "
"upper bound. This is an alpha quality feature; mistakes should be "
"expected.<br><h4>New Driving Visualization</h4><br>The driving visualization"
" will transition to the road-facing wide-angle camera at low speeds to "
"better show some turns. The Experimental mode logo will also be shown in the"
" top right corner."
msgstr ""
"openpilot 預設以輕鬆模式駕駛。實驗模式會啟用尚未適合輕鬆模式的 alpha "
"等級功能，實驗功能如下：<br><h4>端到端縱向控制</h4><br>由駕駛模型控制油門與煞車。openpilot "
"會依它認為人類會怎麼開的方式駕駛，包括在紅燈與停車標誌前停車。由於車速由駕駛模型決定，設定速度只會作為上限。此功能為 alpha "
"品質，可能會出錯。<br><h4>新的駕駛畫面</h4><br>低速時駕駛畫面會切換到道路廣角鏡頭，以更清楚顯示轉彎。畫面右上角也會顯示實驗模式標誌。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/device.py
msgid ""
"openpilot is continuously calibrating, resetting is rarely required. "
"Resetting calibration will restart openpilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr "openpilot 會持續校正，很少需要重設。車輛電源開啟時重設校正，openpilot 會重新啟動。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/firehose.py
msgid ""
"openpilot learns to drive by watching humans, like you, drive.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode allows you to maximize your training data uploads to improve openpilot's driving models. More data means bigger models, which means better Experimental Mode."
msgstr ""
"openpilot 透過觀察像您這樣的人類駕駛來學習開車。\n"
"\n"
"Firehose 模式可讓您盡可能上傳訓練資料，以改進 openpilot 的駕駛模型。資料越多，模型越大，實驗模式就越好。"

